  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Instalação do json-c</title>


    
    

    <!--
    <note>

      <para>
        This package does not support parallel build.
      </para>
    </note>
-->
<!-- Based on https://github.com/json-c/json-c/pull/888 but with the
         addition of tests/CMakeLists.txt to silence another warning.-->
<!--
    <para>

      First, fix building this package with CMake-4.0:
    </para>

<screen><userinput remap="pre">sed -i 's/VERSION 2.8/VERSION 4.0/' apps/CMakeLists.txt  &amp;&amp;
sed -i 's/VERSION 3.9/VERSION 4.0/' tests/CMakeLists.txt</userinput></screen>
    -->
<para>
      Instale <application>json-c</application> executando os seguintes comandos:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release  \
      -D BUILD_STATIC_LIBS=OFF     \
      .. &amp;&amp;
make</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Se tiver instalado <xref linkend="doxygen" role="nodep"/> e <xref
linkend="graphviz" role="nodep"/>, você consegue construir a documentação
executando o seguinte comando:
    </para>

<screen remap="doc"><userinput>doxygen doc/Doxyfile</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      To test the results, issue: <command>make USE_VALGRIND=0 test</command>.
Note that testing with the latest valgrind causes several test failures.
    </para>

    <para>
      Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class="username">root</systemitem>:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>make install</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Se você construiu a documentação, instale-a executando os seguintes comandos
como o(a) usante &root;:
    </para>

<screen role="root" remap="doc"><userinput>install -d -vm755 /usr/share/doc/json-c-&json-c-version; &amp;&amp;
install -v -m644 doc/html/* /usr/share/doc/json-c-&json-c-version;</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="commands">
    <title>Explicações do Comando</title>

    <para>
